Dont print this, save a tree !


Stat-Graph is an User Status tool with Bargraph display !

Iam to lazy to describe it, so simply install it as an arexx pfile !

Run it whereever you want ! 
f.e.: sys.welcome or in your PFiles !

Stat-Graph displays a graph of the users Downloaded megabytes
					 Uploaded megabytes
					 Credits in megabytes


The first scale is from 0 up to 50 megabytes.
If a user have more than 50 megs, the graph display
will automatical switch to a scale of 0 to 500 megabytes !

Well, install it and have phun !

If you have any Problems, feel free to contact me in Lego Land !

